<p>
  {dgettext(
    "help_features",
    "A mention is a message that writes your nickname, or one of your highlight words, in a channel you were in. The chat counts those separately from everything else that is new."
  )}
</p>
<.help_h4 icon={:icon_tab_control}>
  {dgettext("help_features", "Two Numbers, Two Questions")}
</.help_h4>
<ul>
  <li>
    {dgettext(
      "help_features",
      "The grey count beside a conversation says there is something new in it"
    )}
  </li>
  <li>
    {dgettext("help_features", "The red count beside it says some of it is about you")}
  </li>
  <li>{dgettext("help_features", "Opening the conversation clears both")}</li>
</ul>
<.help_h4 icon={:icon_megaphone}>{dgettext("help_features", "The Mentions Window")}</.help_h4>
<p>
  {dgettext(
    "help_features",
    "Start ▸ Mentions lists every message that named you, newest first, across the channels you are in. Clicking one switches to that conversation and scrolls to the line. While anything is waiting, a badge appears in the taskbar tray and opens the same window."
  )}
</p>
<.help_h4 icon={:icon_lightbulb}>{dgettext("help_features", "What Never Counts")}</.help_h4>
<p>
  {dgettext(
    "help_features",
    "Your own messages, deleted messages, and anything the server itself said — a join, a service reply, a notice. Those name people constantly and none of it is somebody reaching for you."
  )}
</p>
<.help_h4 icon={:icon_link}>{dgettext("help_features", "See Also")}</.help_h4>
<p>
  <.help_link topic="feature-highlight-words">
    {dgettext("help_features", "Highlight Words")}
  </.help_link>
  ·
  <.help_link topic="feature-unread-indicators">
    {dgettext("help_features", "Unread Indicators")}
  </.help_link>
</p>
